Local modifications, November 2026:
- Accept legacy QUNS_BUSY only when actual DND and existing banner policy allow it.
- Optional audio fallback for silent Outlook calendar reminders while Outlook is closed.
- Refresh sender identity when Windows reuses UIA notification controls.
- Portable packaging, installation/restore scripts, tests, and documentation.

Windhawk and Windows are separate dependencies. This package does not distribute
Windhawk, Microsoft audio assets, personal notification data, or account settings.
